    "display_name": "Community Events",
    "long_instructions": "## Analyze Patterns\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Look through the `events` array.\r\n2. Count how many events of each type appear.\r\n3. Look at the `location` field across the dataset.\r\n4. Compare the `description` field across events.\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n\r\n- Which type of event appears most often?\r\n- Which type appears least?\r\n- What patterns do you notice about where events are located?\r\n- Which events have more detailed descriptions? Which have less?",
